<title>USA: Wilmington, Del., GOP says to fight mayor's budget.</title>
<headline>Wilmington, Del., GOP says to fight mayor's budget.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Wilmington Republican Committee is trying to defeat Mayor Jim Sills' proposed budget by formulating a spending plan of its own.</p>
<p>Brad Zuber, a member of a task force against the mayor's plan, said a spending increase proposed by the mayor is not needed.</p>
<p>The task force will release its alternative budget in 10 days, when council is scheduled to vote on the mayor's budget.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
